{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","干劲满满"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","使友军获得短暂的伤害减免和属性加成。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","鼓舞自己和全体友军使他们获得暂时的45%伤害减免持续12秒并记录被减免的伤害值，在持续时间结束后这部分伤害值会一次性以真实伤害结算。在此期间，友军们还会获得30 + 3点生命汲取和10%攻击力加成。该效果不可被驱散，且在效果持续期间无法再次释放本技能。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":80,"end":84,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害减免效果提升至50%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害减免效果提升至55%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","获得的生命汲取提升至35 + 3。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","获得的生命汲取提升至40 + 3。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","大口吞肉"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用肉投喂友军或自身，恢复生命值同时提升部分属性。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","投喂最虚弱的1名友军，使其恢复-230% − 20% ATK生命值，并提升10%攻击力，持续5秒。另外，每隔15秒，额外投喂自己坐骑“帕托”恢复自身350% ATK生命值，并提升20点受击回能，持续7秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":2,"end":6,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":15,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":74,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","使友军恢复-240% − 20% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","使友军恢复-250% − 20% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"P